# Textbook Tabulator (0/3): "When this creature enters, surveil 2" - the top Forest stays on top and the Swamp goes to the
# graveyard - and increment. On turn 3 Bot1's one-mana Opt is greater than its power 0, so increment triggers; in response
# Bot2 kills the Tabulator with Lightning Bolt (3 damage), and as the ability resolves the creature is gone (CR 603.4:
# nothing to put a counter on, CR 702.191a): no counter anywhere and the Tabulator in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Textbook Tabulator
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Opt
Island
Island
Forest
Swamp
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Textbook Tabulator.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Forest | Swamp)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Swamp
? Bot1.Battlefield.Textbook Tabulator.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Opt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Textbook Tabulator)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Opt; Textbook Tabulator; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire
